    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Aga Khan University (AKU) was the venue for the first Neuroscience Telemedicine Conference in Pakistan in October 2002. Members from AKU Neuroscience Group and the Department of Neurosurgery, Fujita Health University, Japan, exchanged research and clinical experience in the field of neuroscience with scientific presentations and discussions.",
